WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Opening. Navigation, an editorial headline, and the Explore action establish the company and a clear route into its story.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Problem first. The supply-chain problem gives visitors a reason to care before they encounter the more technical explanation.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Approach. One darker chapter brings the headline, explanation, and three-step production sequence together.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Saffron focus. A concrete product example turns the broader plant-cell-culture platform into something visitors can understand.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Inside the lab. The culture-start and lab sections show how plant material progresses toward an ingredient, using actual page layouts and imagery.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Team & contact. The people behind the work lead into clear contact and newsletter options at the end of the page.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Press page. The same visual language continues into an editorial coverage page with publisher, date, headline, and source links.
